<title>UK: Wassall sells Techno Pack subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Wassall sells Techno Pack subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British diversified industrial company Wassall Plc said on Wednesday it had sold its subsidiary Techno Pack Ltd to WH Dunn &amp; Son Ltd.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that it sold the subsidiary for a nominal consideration.</p>
<p>The sale will result in an exceptional loss on disposal of around 1.7 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
